{"id":"545b51e7aa011030","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-family.md","title":"Indexed Family of Sets","display":"df-family — Indexed Family of Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-family","aliases":["58-df-family"],"display":"df-family — Indexed Family of Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-family — Indexed Family of Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,I \\in V\">\\(F,I \\in V\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Family}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Family}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (indexed-family predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{Family}_S(F,I) \\leftrightarrow \\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{Family}_S(F,I) \\leftrightarrow \\exists B\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Convention</strong>: 通常记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_i)_{i \\in I}\">\\((A_i)_{i \\in I}\\)</span> 表示对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i \\in I\">\\(i \\in I\\)</span> 有一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>Alternative notation</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{A_i : i \\in I\\}\">\\(\\{A_i : i \\in I\\}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A_i \\rangle_{i \\in I}\">\\(\\langle A_i \\rangle_{i \\in I}\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>Tuples</strong>: 对于有限族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_1, \\ldots, A_n)\">\\((A_1, \\ldots, A_n)\\)</span>，可视为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元组或笛卡尔积的因子</li>\n<li><strong>Function view</strong>: 族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_i)_{i \\in I}\">\\((A_i)_{i \\in I}\\)</span> 等价于满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(i)=A_i\">\\(f(i)=A_i\\)</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f : I \\to V\">\\(f : I \\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,I \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\